 "Поэтому каждый раунд отматывается назад целиком": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 680 270\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"30.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">вначале</text><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"30.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">после раунда 1</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"30.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">в конце</text><text x=\"96.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">красные</text><rect x=\"156\" y=\"48\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">189</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"48\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\"/><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">126</text><rect x=\"556\" y=\"48\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">84</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−63</text><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"71.0\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−42</text><text x=\"96.0\" y=\"113.0\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">зелёные</text><rect x=\"156\" y=\"90\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"113.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">153</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"90\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\"/><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"113.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" fo